                      "name": "brBody",
                      "fill": "#c9d6e5",
                      "content": "• Expense amount must be positive and non-zero\n• Category is required; subcategory is optional\n• Date defaults to today if not provided\n• Currency defaults to BRL; supported: BRL, USD, EUR\n• Description max length: 255 characters",
