                  "name": "Technical Approach Section",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "oadCR",
                      "name": "taHead",
                      "fill": "#f5f9ff",
                      "content": "Technical Approach",
                      "fontFamily": "Space Grotesk",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Fad4Y",
                      "name": "taBody",
                      "fill": "#c9d6e5",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                      "width": 976,
                      "height": 67,
                      "content": "Three-layer architecture: HTTP handler → service layer → repository. The handler validates input and maps to domain types. The service layer orchestrates business logic including category suggestion. The repository handles SQLite persistence with prepared statements.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "LavHi",
                  "name": "Component Boundaries Section",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "HcBkx",
                      "name": "cbHead",
                      "fill": "#f5f9ff",
                      "content": "Component Boundaries",
                      "fontFamily": "Space Grotesk",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "v30jv",
                      "name": "cbBody",
                      "fill": "#c9d6e5",
                      "content": "• expense/handler.go — HTTP handlers, request/response mapping\n• expense/service.go — Business logic, validation orchestration\n• expense/repository.go — SQLite CRUD, query builders\n• expense/model.go — Domain types, value objects\n• expense/routes.go — Route registration, middleware binding",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "QA38f",
                  "name": "Integration Points Section",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "YBfiE",
                      "name": "ipHead",
                      "fill": "#f5f9ff",
                      "content": "Integration Points",
                      "fontFamily": "Space Grotesk",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ZrXKi",
                      "name": "ipBody",
                      "fill": "#c9d6e5",
                      "content": "• Database: SQLite via go-sqlite3, connection pool managed by db package\n• Auth: JWT middleware from auth package validates tokens\n• Config: Reads from .oraculo/config.toml for DB path and defaults\n• Logging: Structured logging via slog with request context",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
